### List achievements for Connect Four (gameId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/games/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/achievements

###
//http://localhost:8180/realms/banditgames/protocol/openid-connect/auth?client_id=platform-backend&response_type=code&scope=openid&redirect_uri=http://localhost:3333/callback
### Get access token with admin user
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/banditgames/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=platform-backend&client_secret=**********&username=rufi@rufi&password=rufi

//saving the access token
> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}
###

### Get current player info (before awarding)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/player/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Award "First Connect" to current player
POST http://localhost:8080/api/player/achievements/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###
### Get current player info (after awarding)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/player/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json
